{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016420/extras/3332d5f8e4a30ad7d9775fbcea1798a8.poster.avif?t=1761909874\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016420/extras/3332d5f8e4a30ad7d9775fbcea1798a8.webm?t=1761909874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016420/extras/3332d5f8e4a30ad7d9775fbcea1798a8.mp4?t=1761909874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal The Forgotten Maze is a first-person psychological horror survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Elias, a young IT technician working for a company that recently acquired an old server of unknown origin. While setting up the machine, a mysterious error (&quot;ACCESS VIOLATION: LEVEL 0&quot;) crashes the system. While trying to fix the bug, Elias is pulled into a space outside of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016420/extras/d87bd46ad2ee08df25bf8807d44c99a5.poster.avif?t=1761909874\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016420/extras/d87bd46ad2ee08df25bf8807d44c99a5.webm?t=1761909874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016420/extras/d87bd46ad2ee08df25bf8807d44c99a5.mp4?t=1761909874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He awakens in a place that shouldn't exist\u2014a network of endless, yellowish corridors lit by buzzing lights, where time and space seem to fold in on themselves. This place is known to few as the Backrooms\u2014and to even fewer as a flaw in the very fabric of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is <i>basically</i> a walking simulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal space design of scenes to explore - extremely odd layouts designed to instill familiarity and discomfort</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Find ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016420/a1f8cc15c19ba3779aadb39631d9957a3bfbf422.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016420?t=1761909874","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016420?t=1761909874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016420/60af3246b4f13e198de9ebe3376562b625340ac5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761909874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016420/60af3246b4f13e198de9ebe3376562b625340ac5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761909874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016420/extras/3332d5f8e4a30ad7d9775fbcea1798a8.poster.avif?t=1761909874\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016420/extras/3332d5f8e4a30ad7d9775fbcea1798a8.webm?t=1761909874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"h